'' TKO0803: 'cast( string, x )' takes a var-len STRING that is not a constant, or a UDT
'' casting to one, and fbc refuses everything else with error 20. Measured, fbc-modern
'' rejects exactly lines 24 to 34 of the source -- a literal, a CONST, a folded '&', a
'' folded chr( ) and str( ), a zstring, a 'string * 8', a ustring, a ustring chain, a
'' number, a UDT with no cast -- and accepts the nine controls below them, which include
'' '"a" & i', 'chr( i )', 'hex( 255 )' and 'ucase( "lit" )': fbc folds only some of the
'' string family. tiko accepted all eleven and took each as the identity.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/cast-string-operand.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(24,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: this is a constant, which fbc folds to a literal
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(25,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(26,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(27,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(28,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(29,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: this is a fixed-length string
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(30,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(31,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: this is a ustring
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(32,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: this is a USTRING concatenation
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(33,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: this is not a string
'' EXPECT-OUT: cast-string-operand.bas(34,7): error TKO0803
'' EXPECT-OUT: this is a type with no 'operator cast' to STRING
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 11
